ss="neo-hero-actions mt-8 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-3 sm:mt-9 sm:flex-row sm:gap-3.5"><a class="neo-button neo-button--primary" href="/pricing" data-discover="true">See editing plans</a><a class="neo-button neo-button--primary" href="/portfolio" data-discover="true">Explore editing examples</a></div><p class="neo-hero-proof mx-auto mt-4 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold neo-muted sm:hidden"><span><strong>48 hours</strong> first-cut target</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="neo-hero-proof__separator">·</span><span>Timestamped feedback</span></p><div class="neo-hero-metrics mt-10 grid w-full max-w-md grid-cols-3 items-stretch gap-2 sm:mt-12 sm:flex sm:w-auto sm:max-w-none sm:items-center sm:justify-center sm:gap-3"><div class="neo-pill min-w-0 rounded-2xl px-2 py-2.5 text-center sm:px-4"><p class="text-lg font-black tracking-tight neo-ink">48 hours</p><p class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase leading-4 tracking-[0.1em] neo-muted sm:leading-normal sm:tracking-[0.12em]">first-cut target</p></div><div class="neo-pill min-w-0 rounded-2xl px-2 py-2.5 text-center sm:px-4"><p class="text-lg font-black tracking-tight neo-ink">Clear scope</p><p class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase leading-4 tracking-[0.1em] neo-muted sm:leading-normal sm:tracking-[0.12em]">before editing starts</p></div><div class="neo-pill min-w-0 rounded-2xl px-2 py-2.5 text-center sm:px-4"><p class="text-lg font-black tracking-tight neo-ink">Your feedback</p><p class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase leading-4 tracking-[0.1em] neo-muted sm:leading-normal sm:tracking-[0.12em]">in one workspace</p></div></div></div></section><section id="creators" data-analytics-region="audience" class="border-b neo-line px-5 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:py-24"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl text-center"><div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl"><p class="yt-tag neo-section-label"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-users-round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 21a8 8 0 0 0-16 0"></path><circle cx="10" cy="8" r="5"></circle><path d="M22 20c0-3.37-2-6.5-4-8a5 5 0 0 0-.45-8.3"></path></svg><span class="hidden sm:inline">Who EdiCut is for</span><span class="sm:hidden">Who we edit for</span></p><h2 class="yt-title mt-3 neo-ink">Built around what you create.</h2><p class="mt-4 yt-small leading-6 neo-muted">From gameplay and podcasts to tutorials and property tours, we shape each edit around your audience.</p></div><div class="neo-audience-grid mt-12 space-y-4 sm:space-y-5"><div class="neo-audience-row grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 min-[360px]:grid-cols-2 sm:flex sm:flex-wrap sm:justify-center sm:gap-5"><article class="neo-card group flex w-full max-w-none flex-col items-center rounded-2xl p-4 text-center sm:max-w-[260px] sm:p-5"><span class="neo-icon-badge flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl transition-colors"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[22px]">sports_esports</span></span><h3 class="mt-3.5 text-sm font-black leading-tight neo-ink sm:text-base">Gaming</h3><p class="mt-2 text-xs font-medium leading-5 neo-muted">Fast-paced cuts, highlights, reactions, and stream-to-video edits.</p></article><article class="neo-card group flex w-full max-w-none flex-col items-center rounded-2xl p-4 text-center sm:max-w-[260px] sm:p-5"><span class="neo-icon-badge flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl transition-colors"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[22px]">podcasts</span></span><h3 class="mt-3.5 text-sm font-black leading-tight neo-ink sm:text-base">Podcast</h3><p class="mt-2 text-xs font-medium leading-5 neo-muted">Long-form conversations shaped into polished episodes and clips.</p></article><article class="neo-card group flex w-full max-w-none flex-col items-center rounded-2xl p-4 text-center sm:max-w-[260px] sm:p-5"><span class="neo-icon-badge flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl transition-colors"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[22px]">fitness_center</span></span><h3 class="mt-3.5 text-sm font-black leading-tight neo-ink sm:text-base">Health &amp; fitness</h3><p class="mt-2 text-xs font-medium leading-5 neo-muted">Clear, energetic edits for workouts, coaching, and wellness content.</p></article></div><div class="neo-audience-row grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 min-[360px]:grid-cols-2 sm:flex sm:flex-wrap sm:justify-center sm:gap-5"><article class="neo-card group flex w-full max-w-none flex-col items-center rounded-2xl p-4 text-center sm:max-w-[260px] sm:p-5"><span class="neo-icon-badge flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl transition-colors"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[22px]">home_work</span></span><h3 class="mt-3.5 text-sm font-black leading-tight neo-ink sm:text-base">Real estate</h3><p class="mt-2 text-xs font-medium leading-5 neo-muted">Property tours, market updates, and social-ready listing videos.</p></article><article class="neo-card group flex w-full max-w-none flex-col items-center rounded-2xl p-4 text-center sm:max-w-[260px] sm:p-5"><span class="neo-icon-badge flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl transition-colors"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[22px]">videocam</span></span><h3 class="mt-3.5 text-sm font-black leading-tight neo-ink sm:text-base">Vlogs</h3><p class="mt-2 text-xs font-medium leading-5 neo-muted">Story-driven pacing that keeps everyday footage engaging.</p></article><article class="neo-card group flex w-full max-w-none flex-col items-center rounded-2xl p-4 text-center sm:max-w-[260px] sm:p-5"><span class="neo-icon-badge flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl transition-colors"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[22px]">sentiment_very_satisfied</span></span><h3 class="mt-3.5 text-sm font-black leading-tight neo-ink sm:text-base">Comedy</h3><p class="mt-2 text-xs font-medium leading-5 neo-muted">Tighter timing, punchlines, captions, and memorable moments.</p></article><article class="neo-card group flex w-full max-w-none flex-col items-center rounded-2xl p-4 text-center sm:max-w-[260px] sm:p-5"><span class="neo-icon-badge flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl transition-colors"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[22px]">self_improvement</span></span><h3 class="mt-3.5 text-sm font-black leading-tight neo-ink sm:text-base">Lifestyle</h3><p class="mt-2 text-xs font-medium leading-5 neo-muted">Clean, stylish edits for routines, travel, beauty, and culture.</p></article></div><div class="neo-audience-row grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 min-[360px]:grid-cols-2 sm:flex sm:flex-wrap sm:justify-center sm:gap-5"><article class="neo-card group flex w-full max-w-none flex-col items-center rounded-2xl p-4 text-center sm:max-w-[260px] sm:p-5"><span class="neo-icon-badge flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl transition-colors"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[22px]">school</span></span><h3 class="mt-3.5 text-sm font-black leading-tight neo-ink sm:text-base">Educational</h3><p class="mt-2 text-xs font-medium leading-5 neo-muted">Explainers and lessons that are easy to follow and watch.</p></article><article class="neo-card group flex w-full max-w-none flex-col items-center rounded-2xl p-4 text-center sm:max-w-[260px] sm:p-5"><span class="neo-icon-badge flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl transition-colors"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[22px]">rate_review</span></span><h3 class="mt-3.5 text-sm font-black leading-tight neo-ink sm:text-base">Product reviews</h3><p class="mt-2 text-xs font-medium leading-5 neo-muted">Clear demos, comparisons, b-roll, and buyer-focused storytelling.</p></article><article class="neo-card group flex w-full max-w-none flex-col items-center rounded-2xl p-4 text-center sm:max-w-[260px] sm:p-5"><span class="neo-icon-badge flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl transition-colors"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[22px]">auto_awesome</span></span><h3 class="mt-3.5 text-sm font-black leading-tight neo-ink sm:text-base">And more</h3><p class="mt-2 text-xs font-medium leading-5 neo-muted">Tell us what you make and we will match the right editing lane.</p></article></div></div></div></section><section id="why-hire-us" aria-label="Why hire the EdiCut studio" class="why-hire border-b neo-line px-5 py-14 sm:px-6 sm:py-20"><div class="why-hire__inner"><div class="studio-film studio-film--no-plan studio-film--paused studio-film--poster"><div class="studio-film__screen" role="group" aria-label="Why hire EdiCut — narrated introduction" aria-describedby="_R_6kj5_ _R_6kj5H1_"><div class="studio-film__copy"><span class="studio-film__brand neo-section-label"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-film" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2"></rect><path d="M7 3v18"></path><path d="M3 7.5h4"></path><path d="M3 12h18"></path><path d="M3 16.5h4"></path><path d="M17 3v18"></path><path d="M17 7.5h4"></path><path d="M17 16.5h4"></path></svg>Why EdiCut</span><div class="studio-film__story"><div class="studio-film__titles"><p class="studio-film__title studio-film__title--poster studio-film__copy-layer" aria-hidden="false" data-active="true" data-layout="true" style="--copy-opacity:1;--copy-y:0px">More creating.<br/>Less managing.</p></div><div class="studio-film__captions"><p id="_R_6kj5_" class="studio-film__description studio-film__copy-layer" aria-hidden="false" data-active="true" data-layout="true" style="--copy-opacity:1;--copy-y:0px">A dedicated editor. A project manager. One dashboard for every edit. Meet the studio behind your next video.</p></div></div></div><div class="studio-film__media"><div class="studio-film__artwork" data-scene="0" data-cue="0" data-transition="false"><div class="studio-film__artwork-layer" data-layer="poster" data-active="true" style="--film-time:10;--layer-opacity:1;--layer-x:0px;--layer-scale:1"><svg class="offer-artwork offer-artwork--desktop" viewBox="0 0 600 420" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" style="--offer-card-fill:url(#offer-surface-_R_5j6kj5_)"><defs><linearGradient id="offer-surface-_R_5j6kj5_" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1"><stop stop-color="#f8fafc"></stop><stop offset="1" stop-color="#e9eef3"></stop></linearGradient></defs><g transform="translate(145 76)"><rect class="offer-card" width="376" height="271" rx="18" fill="var(--offer-card-fill)" stroke="#faffff"></rect><text x="24" y="32" class="offer-label">Made for your channel</text><circle cx="350" cy="28" r="4" fill="#28715b"></circle><svg x="23" y="51" width="330" height="180" viewBox="0 0 230 130"><g><defs><clipPath id="recording-scene-_R_2sctj6kj5_"><rect x="0" y="0" width="230" height="130" rx="12"></rect></clipPath></defs><image x="0" y="0" width="230" height="130" href="/artwork/why-hire-us/creator-recording-scene-b93b36d3.svg" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" clip-path="url(#recording-scene-_R_2sctj6kj5_)"></image></g><g><rect x="38" y="107" width="158" height="19" rx="5" fill="#17202a"></rect><text x="117" y="120" text-anchor="middle" fill="white" font-size="10" font-weight="650">Your story, beautifully told.</text></g></svg><rect x="24" y="244" width="234" height="5" rx="2.5" fill="#d3dee6"></rect><rect x="24" y="244" width="160" height="5" rx="2.5" fill="#c91d37"></rect></g><g class="offer-motion offer-motion--reveal" style="--motion-start:0.65;--motion-duration:0.65s"><g transform="translate(29 130)"><rect class="offer-card" width="196" height="91" rx="18" fill="var(--offer-card-fill)" stroke="#faffff"></rect><g transform="translate(39 43)"><circle r="27" fill="#dbe8e3"></circle><image x="-27" y="-27" width="54" height="54" href="/artwork/why-hire-us/editor.svg" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet"></image></g><text x="78" y="35" class="offer-label">Your editor</text><text x="78" y="54" class="offer-small">Knows your style</text><path d="M78 69h94" stroke="#d5dfe7" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"></path></g></g><g class="offer-motion offer-motion--reveal" style="--motion-start:4.96;--motion-duration:0.65s"><g transform="translate(328 295)"><rect class="offer-card" width="242" height="88" rx="18" fill="var(--offer-card-fill)" stroke="#faffff"></rect><g transform="translate(40 43)"><circle r="27" fill="#dae8e1"></circle><image x="-27" y="-27" width="54" height="54" href="/artwork/why-hire-us/manager.svg" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet"></image></g><text x="79" y="35" class="offer-label">Your project manager</text><text x="79" y="55" class="offer-small">Keeps everything on track</text><path d="M80 72l5 5 11-12" stroke="#28715b" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></g></g><g class="offer-motion offer-motion--draw" style="--motion-start:2.4;--motion-duration:1.1s"><path d="M82 103c9-39 48-53 98-40" stroke="#c91d37" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" pathLength="1"></path><path d="m170 55 10 8-12 4" stroke="#c91d37" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" pathLength="1"></path></g></svg><svg class="offer-artwork offer-artwork--mobile" viewBox="0 0 320 280" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect x="4" y="4" width="312" height="272" rx="26" fill="#e9eff3" stroke="#ffffff"></rect><text x="160" y="34" text-anchor="middle" fill="#344657" font-size="20" font-weight="650" font-family="inherit">Made for your channel</text><g><rect x="18" y="48" width="284" height="138" rx="18" fill="#e5edf2" stroke="#d5e0e7"></rect><g><defs><clipPath id="recording-scene-_R_cldj6kj5_"><rect x="18" y="48" width="284" height="138" rx="18"></rect></clipPath></defs><image x="18" y="48" width="284" height="138" href="/artwork/why-hire-us/creator-recording-scene-b93b36d3.svg" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" clip-path="url(#recording-scene-_R_cldj6kj5_)"></image></g><rect x="69" y="150" width="182" height="28" rx="8" fill="#17202a"></rect><text x="160" y="170" text-anchor="middle" fill="#ffffff" font-size="17" font-weight="650" font-family="inherit">Your story, well told</text></g><g class="offer-motion offer-motion--reveal" style="--motion-start:0.65;--motion-duration:0.65s"><g><g><circle cx="48" cy="226" r="22" fill="#f0dde1"></circle><image x="26" y="204" width="44" height="44" href="/artwork/why-hire-us/editor.svg" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet"></image></g><text x="78" y="222" text-anchor="start" fill="#344657" font-size="18" font-weight="650" font-family="inherit">Editor</text><text x="78" y="244" text-anchor="start" fill="#526779" font-size="16" font-weight="500" font-family="inherit">Your style</text></g></g><g class="offer-motion offer-motion--reveal" style="--motion-start:4.96;--motion-duration:0.65s"><g><g><circle cx="188" cy="226" r="22" fill="#e0ece6"></circle><image x="166" y="204" width="44" height="44" href="/artwork/why-hire-us/manager.svg" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet"></image></g><text x="218" y="222" text-anchor="start" fill="#344657" font-size="18" font-weight="650" font-family="inherit">Manager</text><text x="218" y="244" text-anchor="start" fill="#526779" font-size="16" font-weight="500" font-family="inherit">On track</text></g></g></svg></div></div><div class="studio-film__controls"><button type="button" class="studio-film__watch neo-button neo-button--primary" data-play-prompt="false" aria-label="Play"><span class="studio-film__play-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-play" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 5a2 2 0 0 1 3.008-1.728l11.997 6.998a2 2 0 0 1 .003 3.458l-12 7A2 2 0 0 1 5 19z"></path></svg></span><span class="studio-film__watch-label" aria-hidden="true"><span class="studio-film__watch-label-text">Play</span></span></button><button type="button" class="studio-film__sound neo-button" aria-label="Mute film audio" aria-pressed="false" title="Mute sound"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-volume2 lucide-volume-2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11 4.702a.705.705 0 0 0-1.203-.498L6.413 7.587A1.4 1.4 0 0 1 5.416 8H3a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v6a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2.416a1.4 1.4 0 0 1 .997.413l3.383 3.384A.705.705 0 0 0 11 19.298z"></path><path d="M16 9a5 5 0 0 1 0 6"></path><path d="M19.364 18.364a9 9 0 0 0 0-12.728"></path></svg></button></div></div></div><p id="_R_6kj5H1_" class="sr-only">At EdiCut, you get a dedicated editor who understands your style, and a project manager who keeps your videos on track. We handle storytelling, captions, color, and sound, with studio review before your draft reaches you. Your dashboard keeps everything in one place. Start a project, share your brief and footage, and track progress. Communicate with your team, leave feedback on edits, and download your finished videos. Choose a single video or a monthly plan that fits your channel. EdiCut. You create. We handle the edit.</p><audio src="/audio/why-hire-us/edicut-why-hire-us-mix-f3907247.wav" preload="none"></audio></div></div></section><div class="pack-pricing pack-pricing--home"><section id="pricing" data-analytics-region="pricing" class="pack-options pack-container" aria-labelledby="pricing-title"><div class="pack-options-intro"><div><h2 id="pricing-title">Choose the edit you need.</h2><p>One clear price for one finished video, with limits shown up front.</p></div><a class="pack-text-link" href="/pricing?type=single#pack-comparison" data-discover="true">Compare every detail <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentCo