tp://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-gamepad2 lucide-gamepad-2" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="6" x2="10" y1="11" y2="11"></line><line x1="8" x2="8" y1="9" y2="13"></line><line x1="15" x2="15.01" y1="12" y2="12"></line><line x1="18" x2="18.01" y1="10" y2="10"></line><path d="M17.32 5H6.68a4 4 0 0 0-3.978 3.59c-.006.052-.01.101-.017.152C2.604 9.416 2 14.456 2 16a3 3 0 0 0 3 3c1 0 1.5-.5 2-1l1.414-1.414A2 2 0 0 1 9.828 16h4.344a2 2 0 0 1 1.414.586L17 18c.5.5 1 1 2 1a3 3 0 0 0 3-3c0-1.545-.604-6.584-.685-7.258-.007-.05-.011-.1-.017-.151A4 4 0 0 0 17.32 5z"></path></svg></span><div class="home-services__copy"><h3>Gaming video editing</h3><p>Gameplay, stream highlights, and reactions.</p></div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right home-services__arrow" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a></li><li><a class="group home-services__link" href="/services/youtube-thumbnail-design" data-discover="true"><span class="neo-icon-badge home-services__icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-image" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><circle cx="9" cy="9" r="2"></circle><path d="m21 15-3.086-3.086a2 2 0 0 0-2.828 0L6 21"></path></svg></span><div class="home-services__copy"><h3>YouTube thumbnail design</h3><p>A clear visual for your next upload.</p></div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right home-services__arrow" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a></li></ul></nav></div></section><section class="neo-trust-strip border-b neo-line px-5 py-8 sm:px-6"><div class="mx-auto flex max-w-7xl flex-col items-center justify-between gap-5 sm:flex-row"><p class="yt-tag neo-section-label"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-badge-check" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg>A clear process for your next upload</p><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-6 gap-y-3 yt-small font-bold neo-muted"><span>Defined editing scope</span><span>Timestamped feedback</span><span>Final export approval</span></div></div></section><section id="faq" class="site-faq " aria-labelledby="_R_gkj5_"><div class="site-faq__intro"><p class="site-faq__kicker neo-section-label"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-question-mark" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3"></path><path d="M12 17h.01"></path></svg>FAQ</p><h2 class="site-faq__title" id="_R_gkj5_">Good questions.<br/>Straight answers.</h2><p class="site-faq__description">Get to know your team, your edits, and how it all works.</p></div><div class="site-faq__list"><article class="site-faq__item neo-card" data-open="false"><h3><button type="button" id="_R_1dgkj5_-question" class="site-faq__question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_1dgkj5_-answer"><span>How does onboarding work?</span><span class="site-faq__arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="_R_1dgkj5_-answer" class="site-faq__answer" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_1dgkj5_-question" aria-hidden="true" inert=""><div class="site-faq__answer-inner"><p>We collect your channel style, references, brand assets, and delivery preferences before the first edit starts.</p></div></div></article><article class="site-faq__item neo-card" data-open="false"><h3><button type="button" id="_R_2dgkj5_-question" class="site-faq__question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_2dgkj5_-answer"><span>What content types do you edit?</span><span class="site-faq__arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="_R_2dgkj5_-answer" class="site-faq__answer" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_2dgkj5_-question" aria-hidden="true" inert=""><div class="site-faq__answer-inner"><p>Talking-head videos, podcasts, gaming, education, vlogs, product reviews, Shorts, Reels, and TikToks.</p></div></div></article><article class="site-faq__item neo-card" data-open="false"><h3><button type="button" id="_R_3dgkj5_-question" class="site-faq__question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_3dgkj5_-answer"><span>What is your revision policy?</span><span class="site-faq__arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="_R_3dgkj5_-answer" class="site-faq__answer" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_3dgkj5_-question" aria-hidden="true" inert=""><div class="site-faq__answer-inner"><p>Single-video packages include the listed revision rounds. Monthly editing and revisions use your reserved editing hours. We agree the scope before production starts.</p></div></div></article><article class="site-faq__item neo-card" data-open="false"><h3><button type="button" id="_R_4dgkj5_-question" class="site-faq__question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_4dgkj5_-answer"><span>Can I change my editing package?</span><span class="site-faq__arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="_R_4dgkj5_-answer" class="site-faq__answer" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_4dgkj5_-question" aria-hidden="true" inert=""><div class="site-faq__answer-inner"><p>Contact us to discuss a different package for your next project or billing period. We confirm any changes to scope, price, and timing before you pay.</p></div></div></article><article class="site-faq__item neo-card" data-open="false"><h3><button type="button" id="_R_5dgkj5_-question" class="site-faq__question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_5dgkj5_-answer"><span>Which payment methods can I use?</span><span class="site-faq__arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="_R_5dgkj5_-answer" class="site-faq__answer" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_5dgkj5_-question" aria-hidden="true" inert=""><div class="site-faq__answer-inner"><p>Checkout uses Cryptomus for cryptocurrency payments. Choose a supported coin and network on its hosted payment page. Credit cards, debit cards, Apple Pay, and Google Pay are not currently offered at EdiCut checkout.</p></div></div></article></div></section><section id="contact" data-analytics-region="contact" class="px-5 py-14 sm:px-6 sm:py-20 " aria-label="Contact inquiry"><div class="neo-contact-layout mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_0.75fr]"><div class="neo-surface flex flex-col justify-center rounded-[2rem] p-7 sm:p-10"><p class="yt-tag neo-section-label"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-message-circle" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.992 16.342a2 2 0 0 1 .094 1.167l-1.065 3.29a1 1 0 0 0 1.236 1.168l3.413-.998a2 2 0 0 1 1.099.092 10 10 0 1 0-4.777-4.719"></path></svg>Contact us</p><p class="neo-contact-invitation hidden">Have a question? Send it below—we’re happy to help.</p><h2 class="neo-contact-title mt-3 max-w-2xl yt-title neo-ink">Tell us what you are editing next.</h2><p class="neo-contact-description mt-5 max-w-2xl yt-subtitle leading-8 neo-muted">We will review your channel and match you with the most efficient editing lane for your upload rhythm.</p><div class="neo-contact-prompt neo-inset mt-8 flex items-center gap-3 rounded-2xl p-4"><p class="text-sm font-bold leading-6 neo-ink">Tell us your format, volume, and deadline. We will recommend the cleanest lane to start.</p></div></div><form data-analytics-form="contact_inquiry" class="neo-card contact-form grid gap-4 rounded-[2rem] p-5 sm:p-7" aria-busy="false" action="/?index#contact" method="post"><input type="hidden" name="g-recaptcha-response" value=""/><div class="grid gap-x-8 gap-y-4 sm:grid-cols-2"><label class="neo-contact-field grid gap-2 yt-small font-black neo-contact-field--compact"><span class="sr-only sm:not-sr-only">Name</span><input type="text" required="" minLength="2" maxLength="120" autoComplete="name" placeholder="Name" class="neo-inset h-12 min-w-0 w-full rounded-xl px-4 yt-body font-medium outline-none focus:border-foreground" name="name"/></label><label class="neo-contact-field grid gap-2 yt-small font-black neo-contact-field--compact"><span class="sr-only sm:not-sr-only">Email</span><input type="email" required="" maxLength="254" autoComplete="email" placeholder="Email" class="neo-inset h-12 min-w-0 w-full rounded-xl px-4 yt-body font-medium outline-none focus:border-foreground" name="email"/></label></div><label class="grid gap-2 yt-small font-black neo-contact-field--compact"><span class="sr-only sm:not-sr-only">Message</span><textarea name="brief" required="" minLength="20" maxLength="1200" autoComplete="off" placeholder="Message" class="neo-inset min-h-28 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 font-medium outline-none focus:border-foreground"></textarea></label><button type="submit" class="neo-button neo-button--primary w-full">Send inquiry</button><p class="neo-contact-response yt-small font-bold neo-muted">edicutstudio@gmail.com · Replies within 24 hours</p></form></div></section></div></main><footer data-analytics-region="footer" class="neo-footer relative overflow-hidden border-t px-4 sm:px-6"><div class="neo-footer__inner mx-auto max-w-7xl pb-5 pt-8 sm:pb-7 sm:pt-12 md:pb-10 md:pt-14"><div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-[minmax(18rem,1.45fr)_minmax(9rem,1fr)_minmax(11rem,1fr)] md:items-stretch"><section class="neo-footer__lead flex flex-col justify-between p-5 md:p-6"><div><h2 class="type-card-title neo-footer-ink">Plan your next video</h2><p class="mt-2 max-w-md text-sm leading-5 neo-footer-muted sm:text-[15px]">Tell us your video format, footage, and deadline. We will help you choose an editing package.</p></div><a class="neo-button neo-button--dark neo-button--compact mt-6 w-fit" href="/contact" data-discover="true">Discuss your project</a></section><section class="neo-footer__group"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between text-left text-sm font-bold neo-footer-ink md:pointer-events-none md:border-b md:border-[var(--neo-line)] md:pb-3">Explore<span class="footer-mobile-chevron material-symbols-outlined text-[20px] transition-transform duration-200">expand_more</span></button><nav class="grid gap-2 overflow-hidden text-sm transition-[max-height,opacity,padding] duration-200 max-h-0 opacity-0 md:mt-3 md:max-h-none md:overflow-visible md:pb-0 md:opacity-100" aria-label="Explore"><a class="neo-footer-link transition-colors" href="/why-hire-us" data-discover="true">Why Hire Us</a><a class="neo-footer-link transition-colors" href="/services" data-discover="true">Services</a><a class="neo-footer-link transition-colors" href="/pricing" data-discover="true">Pricing</a><a class="neo-footer-link transition-colors" href="/portfolio" data-discover="true">Portfolio</a></nav></section><section class="neo-footer__group"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between text-left text-sm font-bold neo-footer-ink md:pointer-events-none md:border-b md:border-[var(--neo-line)] md:pb-3">Support<span class="footer-mobile-chevron material-symbols-outlined text-[20px] transition-transform duration-200">expand_more</span></button><nav class="grid gap-2 overflow-hidden text-sm transition-[max-height,opacity,padding] duration-200 max-h-0 opacity-0 md:mt-3 md:max-h-none md:overflow-visible md:pb-0 md:opacity-100" aria-label="Support"><a class="neo-footer-link transition-colors" href="/contact" data-discover="true">Contact</a><a class="neo-footer-link transition-colors" href="/faq" data-discover="true">FAQ</a><a class="neo-footer-link transition-colors" hre